4. Customer Behavior & Retention
Business Insight

The analysis identifies a customer with substantial cumulative product spending.

Such customers may be valuable candidates for personalized retention and loyalty initiatives.

However, the spending metric is based on product prices, and the recorded count should not automatically be interpreted as eight distinct orders.

Strategic Recommendations

Segment customers according to total spending.

Apply Recency, Frequency, and Monetary (RFM) analysis.

Develop personalized retention campaigns for high-value customers.

Analyze purchasing categories and repeat-purchase behavior.

