Q9. Median Delivery Time

Key Finding

Median delivery duration: 10 days.

Business Insight

The median provides a useful measure of typical delivery duration.

Because the median is less sensitive to extreme values than the mean, it is suitable for evaluating the middle of the delivery-time distribution.

The 10-day result establishes a baseline for further logistics analysis.

However, it does not independently establish whether delivery performance meets customer expectations.

Strategic Recommendations

Compare median delivery times across states.

Identify sellers associated with long delivery durations.

Measure differences between estimated and actual delivery dates.

Monitor the percentage of orders delivered on time.

Investigate unusually delayed deliveries.

Expected Business Impact: Better logistics performance monitoring and more targeted operational improvements.

